sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as HttpClient
    participant Retry as RetryMiddleware
    participant Attempt as One attempt of the client
    participant API as Todo API

    Client->>+Retry: __call__(call, call_next)
    loop up to TODO_API_RETRY_ATTEMPTS, 3 by default
        Retry->>+Attempt: call_next()
        Attempt->>+API: POST /v1/items/plan, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
        API-->>-Attempt: answer, or none
        Attempt-->>-Retry: success, or ApiUnavailableError
        Note over Retry: success, a status, or the last attempt: leave the loop
        Note over Retry: ApiUnavailableError: WARN "api client call retried", wait 100ms doubled, plus or minus 50 percent
        Note over Retry: the caller's cancellation ends the wait: CancelledError passes through
    end
    Retry-->>-Client: the outcome of the last attempt
